---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Disclaimer";
const description =
  "Important limitations concerning the educational content published on HowToWriteYourMemoirs.com.";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <article>
    <p><a href="/">← Back to home</a></p>

    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>

    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 1, 2026</p>

    <h2>Educational Information Only</h2>

    <p>
      The content on HowToWriteYourMemoirs.com is provided for general
      educational and informational purposes.
    </p>

    <p>
      It is not a substitute for advice from a qualified lawyer, editor,
      publisher, medical professional, mental-health professional, financial
      adviser, or other specialist.
    </p>

    <h2>Legal and Privacy Issues</h2>

    <p>
      Writing about real people and events may involve privacy, confidentiality,
      copyright, defamation, contractual, and other legal issues.
    </p>

    <p>
      Laws vary between countries and circumstances. Obtain qualified legal
      advice before publishing material that could affect another person's
      rights or interests.
    </p>

    <h2>Sensitive Personal Experiences</h2>

    <p>
      Memoir writing may involve trauma, illness, bereavement, abuse, family
      conflict, or other sensitive experiences.
    </p>

    <p>
      The website does not provide medical or psychological treatment. Seek
      appropriate professional support where needed.
    </p>

    <h2>Publishing Outcomes</h2>

    <p>
      We do not guarantee that following website guidance will result in a
      publishing contract, book sales, reviews, income, audience growth, or any
      other particular outcome.
    </p>

    <h2>External Services</h2>

    <p>
      References or links to books, retailers, platforms, professionals, or
      external resources do not guarantee their suitability for every visitor.
    </p>

    <p>
      Review the terms and information provided by each third party before
      relying on or purchasing from them.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Responsibility</h2>

    <p>
      You are responsible for decisions concerning your manuscript, publication,
      disclosures, professional advisers, purchases, and use of the information
      on this website.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>

    <p>
      Questions about this Disclaimer may be sent to:
      <a href="mailto:[privacy email]">[privacy email]</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
